 "summary": "No duplication: `AlternatingMap.bilinMap` has no Mathlib counterpart (`Alternating/Curry.lean` offers only `curryLeft`, landing in alternating maps rather than `LinearMap.BilinMap`; `Orientation.areaForm` is the oriented 2D case), and `lMuNuOdd`/`lMuNuVA` have no in-repo equivalent \u2014 the repo's only Levi-Civita material is a `Fin 4` component symbol on `realLorentzTensor`. Proofs delegate to located upstream lemmas (`curryLeft_same`, `map_vecCons_add/smul`, `map_eq_zero_of_eq`, `isSymm_iff_flip`, `IsAlt.neg_eq`, `Basis.det_self`, `FinVec.etaExpand_eq`), and the per-type `lMuNuOdd_*` restatements each serve simp through a non-reducible def or a consumer in this PR.",
